      "seed": 1203770361,
      "version": 2008,
      "versionNonce": 828524142,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776294395992,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  CPU\n    - Bus& bus_\n    - registers (A..E,H,L)\n    - Special registers\n    - flags (Z,N,H,C)\n    - IME  (write only) \n      at boot, IME = 0\n    - bool halted (for HALT instr.)\n    - bool stopped (for STOP instr.)\n    - uint16t[5] interrupt_vector (type -> adr)\n   -------------------------------------------\n    + step()  (executes 1 instr -> cycle count)\n    + reset() (init registers)\n   -------------------------------------------\n    - read8(addr)***\n    - write8(addr, val) ***\n    - handle_interrupt(uint8t pending) (all type)\n    - service interrupt(int type)\n    \n\n*** forwards to {bus.read8() or bus.write8()}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "OVk3PuGLcy3JFaqOc-Vri",
      "originalText": "  CPU\n    - Bus& bus_\n    - registers (A..E,H,L)\n    - Special registers\n    - flags (Z,N,H,C)\n    - IME  (write only) \n      at boot, IME = 0\n    - bool halted (for HALT instr.)\n    - bool stopped (for STOP instr.)\n    - uint16t[5] interrupt_vector (type -> adr)\n   -------------------------------------------\n    + step()  (executes 1 instr -> cycle count)\n    + reset() (init registers)\n   -------------------------------------------\n    - read8(addr)***\n    - write8(addr, val) ***\n    - handle_interrupt(uint8t pending) (all type)\n    - service interrupt(int type)\n    \n\n*** forwards to {bus.read8() or bus.write8()}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
