      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776287910252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  BUS\n    - Timer& timer;\n    - Cart& cart_\n    - PPU& ppu_\n    - Joypad& joypad;\n    - Interrupt Controller& interrupts_\n   ----------------------------------------------------------------\n    + read8(uint16_t addr); / mapping (lots of ifs)\n    + write8(uint16_t addr, uint8_t val); / mapping (this too\n  -----------------------------------------------------------------\n\nmap:\n    Cartridge:\n  0x0000–0x7FFF\n  0xA000–0xBFFF\nPPU:\n  0x8000–0x9FFF (VRAM)\n  0xFE00–0xFE9F (OAM)\n  0xFF40–0xFF4B (registers)\nTimer:\n  0xFF04–0xFF07\nJoypad:\n  0xFF00\nInterrupts:\n  0xFF0F (IF)\n  0xFFFF (IE)\nWRAM:\n  0xC000–0xDFFF\nHRAM:\n  0xFF80–0xFFFE",
      "fontSize": 21.32077703467391,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "G6qw5b4zYkI5VHoBShZYh",
      "originalText": "  BUS\n    - Timer& timer;\n    - Cart& cart_\n    - PPU& ppu_\n    - Joypad& joypad;\n    - Interrupt Controller& interrupts_\n   ----------------------------------------------------------------\n    + read8(uint16_t addr); / mapping (lots of ifs)\n    + write8(uint16_t addr, uint8_t val); / mapping (this too\n  -----------------------------------------------------------------\n\nmap:\n    Cartridge:\n  0x0000–0x7FFF\n  0xA000–0xBFFF\nPPU:\n  0x8000–0x9FFF (VRAM)\n  0xFE00–0xFE9F (OAM)\n  0xFF40–0xFF4B (registers)\nTimer:\n  0xFF04–0xFF07\nJoypad:\n  0xFF00\nInterrupts:\n  0xFF0F (IF)\n  0xFFFF (IE)\nWRAM:\n  0xC000–0xDFFF\nHRAM:\n  0xFF80–0xFFFE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
