      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    Cartridge\n        - vector<uint8> rom\n        - vector<uint8> ram\n        - unique<MBC>\n        ------------------------------------------\n        + read8(addr) *\n        + write8(addr, val) *\n\n*map to mbc->read(addr) or mbc->write(...)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "XoPiiL1wMxA02fJTFn0yj",
      "originalText": "    Cartridge\n        - vector<uint8> rom\n        - vector<uint8> ram\n        - unique<MBC>\n        ------------------------------------------\n        + read8(addr) *\n        + write8(addr, val) *\n\n*map to mbc->read(addr) or mbc->write(...)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
