      "text": "  timer\n    + timer.read(addr)\n    + timer.write(addr, val)\n\nmap:\n    0xFF04 -> DIV (+1 @ 16384Hz, reset at 'stop' or write\n    0xFF05 -> TIMA (timer counter)\n    0xFF06 -> TMA (timer modulo when TIMA overflows)\n    0xFF07 -> TAC (",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "S6gglFz3xtcssOWrgWywD",
      "originalText": "  timer\n    + timer.read(addr)\n    + timer.write(addr, val)\n\nmap:\n    0xFF04 -> DIV (+1 @ 16384Hz, reset at 'stop' or write\n    0xFF05 -> TIMA (timer counter)\n    0xFF06 -> TMA (timer modulo when TIMA overflows)\n    0xFF07 -> TAC (",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
