      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776294030091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  Interrupt Controller\n    - IE (interrupt enabled)\n    - IF (interrupt flag, devices requested)\n   -------------------------------------------------\n    + request(type) (set the type's bit in IF)\n             ex : IF |= (1 << type);\n    + read(addr) **\n    + write(addr,val)**\n    + clear(type);\n    \n** for IE or IF registers only**\n\neach interrupt has fixed address\nVBlank  → 0x40\nLCD     → 0x48\nTimer   → 0x50\nSerial  → 0x58\nJoypad  → 0x60\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20.007699248052894,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "kJh4X-fn9MUc9v9ELjQiz",
      "originalText": "  Interrupt Controller\n    - IE (interrupt enabled)\n    - IF (interrupt flag, devices requested)\n   -------------------------------------------------\n    + request(type) (set the type's bit in IF)\n             ex : IF |= (1 << type);\n    + read(addr) **\n    + write(addr,val)**\n    + clear(type);\n    \n** for IE or IF registers only**\n\neach interrupt has fixed address\nVBlank  → 0x40\nLCD     → 0x48\nTimer   → 0x50\nSerial  → 0x58\nJoypad  → 0x60\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
