      "updated": 1776295100714,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Instruction execution flow: \n\nbus.read IF and IE\n-> pending = IF & IE;\n-> if pending AND IME , handle_interrupt(pending)\n\nfetch -> decode -> execute\nex. LD A, (0x8000)\n-> cpu calls read8(0x8000)\n-> bus.read8(0x8000)\n-> bus routes to PPU via \n    MMU map",
      "fontSize": 20.987214110039286,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instruction execution flow: \n\nbus.read IF and IE\n-> pending = IF & IE;\n-> if pending AND IME , handle_interrupt(pending)\n\nfetch -> decode -> execute\nex. LD A, (0x8000)\n-> cpu calls read8(0x8000)\n-> bus.read8(0x8000)\n-> bus routes to PPU via \n    MMU map",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
