      "versionNonce": 374125170,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776287910252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    MBC (abstract class)\n        - vector& rom_ (const because read only)\n        - vector& ram_ \n       ---------––––––––––--------------\n        + read8(addr) = 0\n        + write8(addr, val) = 0\n        - MBC(& rom, & ram) : rom_(rom), ram_(ram)\n\n* even though MBC1, MBC3, etc  have different\nbehaviors, externally only read and write are\nperformed for all",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "XvaN98Z4RnRzAcq_APXnJ",
      "originalText": "    MBC (abstract class)\n        - vector& rom_ (const because read only)\n        - vector& ram_ \n       ---------––––––––––--------------\n        + read8(addr) = 0\n        + write8(addr, val) = 0\n        - MBC(& rom, & ram) : rom_(rom), ram_(ram)\n\n* even though MBC1, MBC3, etc  have different behaviors, externally only read and write are performed for all",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
