      "versionNonce": 1802810610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776287910252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "   MBC1\n     \"dual mode banking\"\n\n        - uint rom_bank_lo5_ = 1 (only low 5 bits)\n        - uint either_bank_hi2_ = 0 (high 2 bits)\n            if for RAM -> range from $00-$03\n            if for ROM -> $XX are upper bits\n            if no space on both -> nothing\n        - bool ram_enabled_ = false\n        - uint mode_ = 0 for ROM (1 for ram) \n\n        - rom_bank_count\n        - ram_bank_count\n\n     -----------------------------------------------\n        + read8(addr) override\n        + write8(addr, val) override\n\n        - clamp_rom_bank \n        - clamp_ram_bank \n\n* the 4 private registers are write only",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "aueZWq6F8HBeTwyZNGLwb",
      "originalText": "   MBC1\n     \"dual mode banking\"\n\n        - uint rom_bank_lo5_ = 1 (only low 5 bits)\n        - uint either_bank_hi2_ = 0 (high 2 bits)\n            if for RAM -> range from $00-$03\n            if for ROM -> $XX are upper bits\n            if no space on both -> nothing\n        - bool ram_enabled_ = false\n        - uint mode_ = 0 for ROM (1 for ram) \n\n        - rom_bank_count\n        - ram_bank_count\n\n     -----------------------------------------------\n        + read8(addr) override\n        + write8(addr, val) override\n\n        - clamp_rom_bank \n        - clamp_ram_bank \n\n* the 4 private registers are write only",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
