      "text": "if 0x0147 == 0x01 ||\n0x02 || 0x03",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "IczDKLoHMxHZ7GoOJOCdb",
      "originalText": "if 0x0147 == 0x01 || 0x02 || 0x03",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "42Df4fgp6y80GxCtK7zZe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 835.3362604419979,
      "y": 4207.5884743277975,
      "width": 490.60343071957317,
      "height": 943.1202080496615,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 148275502,
      "version": 2143,
      "versionNonce": 1521593586,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "zcGrlIQYf1pkBYPPUDesG",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1776290451296,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE:\n\n0x0000–1FFF:\n    - if val of $0A : update ram_rtc_enabled = true\n    - if val 00 -> false\n0x2000–3FFF:\n    - ROM bank (7 bits) so rom_bank = val & 0x7F\n    - if rom_bank == 0 -> 1\n0x4000–5FFF:\n    - if val <= 0x03: \n        update ram_bank = val\n        rtc_selected_ = false\n    - elif 0x08 <= val <= 0x0C: RTC_selected = val\n        $08 -> Seconds\n    - else -> return\n0x6000–7FFF:\n    - if last_latch_write == 0x00 and val == 0x01\n        latch_clock()\n    - last_latch_write_ = val;\n0xA000–BFFF:\n    - if ram_rtc_enabled == false\n        return;\n    - elif  0x08 <= rtc_selected <= 0x0C\n        write_rtc_register(val);\n    - else:\n        ram_[ram_bank * 0x2000 + offset] = val\n----------------------------------------------------\nREAD:\n\n0x0000–3FFF → ROM bank # 0\n    - rom_[addr]\n0x4000–7FFF → ROM bank # rom_bank_\n    - bank = clamp_rom_bank ...\n    - indx = bank * 0x4000 + (addr - 0x4000)\n    - rom_[index]\n0xA000–BFFF:\n    - if ram_rtc_enabled == false: 0xFF\n    - elif  0x08 <= rtc_selected <= 0x0C\n            read_rtc_register(rtc_selected);\n    - else\n           return  ram_[ram_bank * 0x2000 + offset]",
      "fontSize": 18.402345522920225,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE:\n\n0x0000–1FFF:\n    - if val of $0A : update ram_rtc_enabled = true\n    - if val 00 -> false\n0x2000–3FFF:\n    - ROM bank (7 bits) so rom_bank = val & 0x7F\n    - if rom_bank == 0 -> 1\n0x4000–5FFF:\n    - if val <= 0x03: \n        update ram_bank = val\n        rtc_selected_ = false\n    - elif 0x08 <= val <= 0x0C: RTC_selected = val\n        $08 -> Seconds\n    - else -> return\n0x6000–7FFF:\n    - if last_latch_write == 0x00 and val == 0x01\n        latch_clock()\n    - last_latch_write_ = val;\n0xA000–BFFF:\n    - if ram_rtc_enabled == false\n        return;\n    - elif  0x08 <= rtc_selected <= 0x0C\n        write_rtc_register(val);\n    - else:\n        ram_[ram_bank * 0x2000 + offset] = val\n----------------------------------------------------\nREAD:\n\n0x0000–3FFF → ROM bank # 0\n    - rom_[addr]\n0x4000–7FFF → ROM bank # rom_bank_\n    - bank = clamp_rom_bank ...\n    - indx = bank * 0x4000 + (addr - 0x4000)\n    - rom_[index]\n0xA000–BFFF:\n    - if ram_rtc_enabled == false: 0xFF\n    - elif  0x08 <= rtc_selected <= 0x0C\n            read_rtc_register(rtc_selected);\n    - else\n           return  ram_[ram_bank * 0x2000 + offset]",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TGrXE2gdon-CyxWkon8ob",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 218.79997657534994,
      "y": 4099.01076196787,
      "width": 585.3616682948756,
      "height": 736.093820916809,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1106900018,
      "version": 2968,
      "versionNonce": 569610482,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776287910252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITES:\n(rom, its not writing to memory dw, changes only registers)\nif addr 0x0000-0x1FFF :\n    - update RAM_enable \n    - val's lower 4 bits == A -> enable, else disabled\n\nif addr 0x2000-0x3FFF:\n    - update rom_bank_lo5_\n    - extract lo5 bits (i.e value & 0x1F) -> bank's lo5\n\nif addr 0x4000-0x5FFF:\n    - update either_bank_hi2_ \n        (rom or ram depends on mode)\n    -  extract val's lo2 bits (value & 0x03) -> bank's hi2\n    - this will get shifted later by 5 :  [ - - l o  _ _ _ _]\n        ( total bank number register is only 7 bits)\n\nif addr 0x6000-0x7FFF:\n    - update mode_ = val & 0000 0001 or 0x01\n---------------------------------------------------------------\nif addr in 0xA000 - 0xBFFF and mode = 1\n    - check if ram_enabled, else -> 0xFF! (return hi as handling)\n    - find bank # which is simply bank_hi2\n    - calculate offset = # bank * 0x2000 + (addr - 0xA000)\n    - ram[offset] = value\n\nif addr in 0xA000 - 0xBFFF and mode = 0\n    - go to # 00\n    - ram[offset] = value\n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 18.402345522920225,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITES:\n(rom, its not writing to memory dw, changes only registers)\nif addr 0x0000-0x1FFF :\n    - update RAM_enable \n    - val's lower 4 bits == A -> enable, else disabled\n\nif addr 0x2000-0x3FFF:\n    - update rom_bank_lo5_\n    - extract lo5 bits (i.e value & 0x1F) -> bank's lo5\n\nif addr 0x4000-0x5FFF:\n    - update either_bank_hi2_ \n        (rom or ram depends on mode)\n    -  extract val's lo2 bits (value & 0x03) -> bank's hi2\n    - this will get shifted later by 5 :  [ - - l o  _ _ _ _]\n        ( total bank number register is only 7 bits)\n\nif addr 0x6000-0x7FFF:\n    - update mode_ = val & 0000 0001 or 0x01\n---------------------------------------------------------------\nif addr in 0xA000 - 0xBFFF and mode = 1\n    - check if ram_enabled, else -> 0xFF! (return hi as handling)\n    - find bank # which is simply bank_hi2\n    - calculate offset = # bank * 0x2000 + (addr - 0xA000)\n    - ram[offset] = value\n\nif addr in 0xA000 - 0xBFFF and mode = 0\n    - go to # 00\n    - ram[offset] = value\n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kvkx9FqrwQ1PkdCMIjepL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -344.60049902850676,
      "y": 3833.5135261643404,
      "width": 513.6471501127103,
      "height": 782.0996847241096,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1609791090,
      "version": 3646,
      "versionNonce": 116957874,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776287910252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "READ\n(rom)\nif addr 0x0000 - 0x3FFF and mode = 1\n    - go to bank (hi2_ << 5)\n        - maps to 0x00 if hi2_ == 00\n        example \n        - maps to 0x20 if hi2_ == 01\n        - maps to 0x40 if hi2_ == 10\n        - maps to 0x60 if hi2_ == 11\n\nif addr 0x4000 - 0x7FFF and mode = 1\n    - got to bank (high << 5) | low\n\nif addr 0x0000 - 0x3FFF and mode = 0\n    - go to rom bank 00\n\nif addr 0x4000 - 0x7FFF and mode = 0\n    - go to bank # (hi2 << 5) | lo5 \n    - if bank # == 00, 20,40,60 -> bank += 1\n---------------------------------------------------------------\n(ram)\nif addr in 0xA000 - 0xBFFF and mode = 1\n    - check if ram_enabled\n    - find bank # which is simply bank_hi2\n    - calculate offset = # bank * 0x2000 + (addr -\n0xA000)\nif addr in 0xA000 - 0xBFFF and mode = 0\n    - go to # 00\n\n \n\n        \n     \n ",
      "fontSize": 18.402345522920225,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "READ\n(rom)\nif addr 0x0000 - 0x3FFF and mode = 1\n    - go to bank (hi2_ << 5)\n        - maps to 0x00 if hi2_ == 00\n        example \n        - maps to 0x20 if hi2_ == 01\n        - maps to 0x40 if hi2_ == 10\n        - maps to 0x60 if hi2_ == 11\n\nif addr 0x4000 - 0x7FFF and mode = 1\n    - got to bank (high << 5) | low\n\nif addr 0x0000 - 0x3FFF and mode = 0\n    - go to rom bank 00\n\nif addr 0x4000 - 0x7FFF and mode = 0\n    - go to bank # (hi2 << 5) | lo5 \n    - if bank # == 00, 20,40,60 -> bank += 1\n---------------------------------------------------------------\n(ram)\nif addr in 0xA000 - 0xBFFF and mode = 1\n    - check if ram_enabled\n    - find bank # which is simply bank_hi2\n    - calculate offset = # bank * 0x2000 + (addr - 0xA000)\nif addr in 0xA000 - 0xBFFF and mode = 0\n    - go to # 00\n\n \n\n        \n     \n ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
