      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776294964939,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    Interrupt Service (in handle)\n\n    - clear all interupts via ime\n    - acknowledge the interrupt\n        - remove the type bit in IF\n        - but keep everything else\n        - how? mask \n        - IF &= ~(1 << type);\n    - push pc to stack\n    - pc = interrupt_vec[type]\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ET8rybzLiZWGh1aylKRKE",
      "originalText": "    Interrupt Service (in handle)\n\n    - clear all interupts via ime\n    - acknowledge the interrupt\n        - remove the type bit in IF\n        - but keep everything else\n        - how? mask \n        - IF &= ~(1 << type);\n    - push pc to stack\n    - pc = interrupt_vec[type]\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
