      "updated": 1776295016294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    handle_interrupt (in handle)\n\n    type priority interrupts:\n        4 == joypad,  (lowest)\n        3 == serial, \n        2 == timer,  \n        1 == LCD\n        0 == VBlank (highest)\n        \nso for priority i = 0 -> 4:\n    if pending & (1 << i)\n        interrupt service\n        break (so only highest pr)\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        \n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "6SGMhWejwFeeQgEPSFdEe",
      "originalText": "    handle_interrupt (in handle)\n\n    type priority interrupts:\n        4 == joypad,  (lowest)\n        3 == serial, \n        2 == timer,  \n        1 == LCD\n        0 == VBlank (highest)\n        \nso for priority i = 0 -> 4:\n    if pending & (1 << i)\n        interrupt service\n        break (so only highest pr)\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        \n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
